te of the terminal point, and ${y}_{1}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the initial point.\n\nIn our case, ${y}_{2}=2$ and ${y}_{1}=0.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1}=2-0=2.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259671 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179732 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e6935944-0acd-5593-aa80-e56f6014c13f" :knowledge-point/title "Line Integrals of Unity With Respect to Y"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "222f7372-478c-5a27-a063-8b07e8f92f6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257061} {:answer/id #uuid "260fe7e6-dcde-5d6f-bd01-230ec63c06ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257111} {:answer/id #uuid "457aa27e-2b18-5b49-aa06-db270cc7943d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\pi " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257390} {:answer/id #uuid "81299222-742a-5d9d-a15d-9944b4e165e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257930} {:answer/id #uuid "a82500ae-ffed-5208-83ef-1952b452cd21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\pi " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258250}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "260fe7e6-dcde-5d6f-bd01-230ec63c06ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257111} :answer-field/id #uuid "c408b8b1-0a44-526d-8f26-98e22333e00c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186259374}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9f388a61-d9fb-5445-8bd4-8cd72f371aff" :question/math-academy-id "q-124335" :question/problem "![](images/96/963f8812eb8226617c7d893ebdf675747ebed12c92fc6369de2b153a1c2e3b58.png)\n\nCalculate ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y,$ where $C$ is the path along the semicircle of radius $2,$ transversed from the point $(1,-2)$ to the point $(1,2),$ as shown above." :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to $y$ along a path $C$ is equal to the net change in $y$ between the terminal and initial points:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{2}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the terminal point, and ${y}_{1}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the initial point.\n\nIn our case, ${y}_{2}=2$ and ${y}_{1}=-2.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1}=2-(-2)=4.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259672 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179732 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e6935944-0acd-5593-aa80-e56f6014c13f" :knowledge-point/title "Line Integrals of Unity With Respect to Y"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "55c54a1b-25be-5636-b467-f5ac1a9b52a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257520} {:answer/id #uuid "90ca79dc-a39f-5a16-a0bb-06f5058a2325" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258059} {:answer/id #uuid "90fced00-d179-5243-b71b-5f2af240f1e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5+5\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258062} {:answer/id #uuid "f4d9b801-9124-53be-9f21-3845b38cdb84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258919} {:answer/id #uuid "f8d92c55-a2da-5101-b6a0-b111b36b6752" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258966}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4d9b801-9124-53be-9f21-